        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-784, Modern Ridges at Edge Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Ridged Cabinet Knob is a unique piece for a modern space. Made by RK International, this funky piece will bring an ultra-modern feel to any kitchen or bathroom cabinet with a since of movement that is sometimes lost on the sharp lines of modern hardware. It is available in satin nickel, polished nickel, antique english, and oil rubbed bronze finishes. Choose from either a 1-1/4 inch size or a 1-1/2 inch size.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/modern-ridged-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-883\"><b>Modern Ridged Cabinet Pull</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-ridged-door-pull-rk-international-ph-4883\"><b>Modern Ridged Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-784 Modern Cylinder Cabinet Hardware:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long 8/32 machine screw</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-784:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-CK-783:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
